id: limit-of-the-super-saiyan-recovery
name: Limit of the Super Saiyan
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
# A Special Maneuver, open while its Trait effect applies (its `allow`).
special: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  As an Instant Maneuver, you can spend a stack of Battle Born to regain Ki Points and Capacity equal to 1/4 of your Max Capacity.
text: >
  As an Instant Maneuver, you can spend a stack of Battle Born to regain Ki Points and Capacity equal to 1/4 of your Max Capacity.
  –Maneuver Type: Instant Maneuver
  –Action Cost: N/A
  –KP Cost: N/A (a stack of Battle Born)
  –Effect: Regain Ki Points and Capacity equal to 1/4 of your Max Capacity.

---

[on used]
spendBattleBorn(ki-capacity);
